          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 120523,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>JS nesnesinin ne olduğunu zaten biliyorsun. Şimdi JSON'un ne olduğunu öğrenelim.</p><p>JSON, <strong>JavaScript Object Notation</strong> ifadesinin kısaltmasıdır. Bu veri biçimini web uygulamaları ve sunucular arasında veri alışverişi yapmak için kullanabiliriz.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "JSON quote",
            "id": 120529,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>JSON, normal bir JS nesnesinin <em>string'e dönüştürülmüş</em> bir sürümü gibi görünür.</p><p><code>jsonVariable</code>'ı normal bir <code>{}</code> nesnesi gibi oluşturabilir, ancak tek tırnak <code>'</code> içine alabilirsin.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" jsonVariable = \" /><text value=\"'{}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>'</code>, ardından <code>{</code> ve sonra <code>}</code>, <code>'</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "JSON quotes",
            "id": 120524,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir JSON nesnesi, bir JS nesnesine benzer şekilde anahtar-değer çiftlerinden oluşan bir koleksiyon içerir.</p><p>Ancak JSON'da anahtarları, burada <code>\"times\"</code> örneğinde olduğu gibi tırnak işaretleri arasına almamız gerekir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" jsonString = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;story&quot;: &quot;Life&quot;, &quot;times&quot;: 2, &quot;fiction&quot;: true }'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"</code>, ardından <code>times</code> ve son olarak <code>\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir JSON nesnesi, bir JS nesnesine benzer şekilde anahtar-değer çiftlerinden oluşan bir koleksiyon içerir.</p><p>JSON anahtarları, <code>\"story\"</code> gibi çift tırnak içinde olmalıdır. <code>2</code> değeri için <code>times</code> anahtarını tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" jsonString = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;story&quot;: &quot;Life&quot;, &quot;times&quot;: 2, &quot;fiction&quot;: true }'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"fiction\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"</code>, ardından <code>times</code> ve son olarak <code>\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "JSON data types",
            "id": 120525,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>JSON nesneleri sayılar, diziler, boolean değerleri veya dizeler gibi statik verileri bir araya getirebilir. Ancak içlerinde <strong>fonksiyon</strong> saklayamazlar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" story = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;story&quot;: &quot;Life&quot;,&quot;times&quot;: 2,&quot;fiction&quot;: true}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function(){}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>true</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>JSON nesneleri sayılar, diziler, boolean değerleri veya dizeler gibi statik verileri bir araya getirebilir. Ancak içlerinde <strong>fonksiyon</strong> saklayamazlar.</p><p>JSON dizesini <code>fiction</code> özelliğinin boolean değeri <code>true</code> olacak şekilde tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" story = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;story&quot;: &quot;Life&quot;,&quot;times&quot;: 2,&quot;fiction&quot;: true}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function() {}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"fiction\"</code>, ardından <code>true</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "JSON vs JS object",
            "id": 120526,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki veri türü nedir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rainbow = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"colors\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": [\" /><text value=\"&quot;red&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yellow&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;green&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;blue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;purple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"],\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rain\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Bir JS nesnesi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir JSON</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Bir JS nesnesi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>rainbow</code> öğesine atanan değeri, içeriğini değiştirmeden tek tırnak içine alıyorsun. Bu geçerli bir JSON mu?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rainbow = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"colors\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": [\" /><text value=\"&quot;red&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yellow&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;green&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;blue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;purple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"],\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rain\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Hayır, anahtarların da çift tırnak içinde olması gerekir.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Evet, dışına tırnak eklemek yeterlidir.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hayır, JSON diziler içeremez.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Hayır, anahtarların da çift tırnak içinde olması gerekir.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "JSON Stringify",
            "id": 120527,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>JSON.stringify()</code> metoduyla bir JS nesnesini JSON'a dönüştürebiliriz.</p><p>Burada <code>JSON.stringify(concert)</code> kullanırsak <code>concert</code> JS nesnesini bir JSON nesnesine dönüştürebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" concert = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"band\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Super Carrots&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"music\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Indie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(concert);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".stringify(concert));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"117\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{ band: 'Super Carrots', music: 'Indie' }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"{&quot;band&quot;:&quot;Super Carrots&quot;,&quot;music&quot;:&quot;Indie&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>JSON</code>, ardından <code>stringify</code> ve son olarak <code>concert</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>JSON.stringify()</code> metoduyla bir JS nesnesini JSON'a dönüştürebiliriz.</p><p>Daha kesin bir ifadeyle, <code>JSON.stringify()</code> JSON biçiminde bir dize döndürür.</p><p>İkinci konsol çıktısı için nesnenin tamamını bir JSON dizesine dönüştür.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" concert = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"band\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Super Carrots&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"music\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Indie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(concert);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".stringify(concert));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"parse\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"object\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"music\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{ band: 'Super Carrots', music: 'Indie' }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"{&quot;band&quot;:&quot;Super Carrots&quot;,&quot;music&quot;:&quot;Indie&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>JSON</code>, ardından <code>stringify</code> ve son olarak <code>concert</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "JSON parse",
            "id": 120528,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir JSON dizesini <code>JSON.parse()</code> metoduyla bir JS nesnesine de dönüştürebiliriz.</p><p>Parantezlerin içine <code>dog</code> eklersek JSON dizesini bir JS nesnesine dönüştürürüz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dog = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Rocko&quot;,&quot;age&quot;:3}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".parse(dog));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"66\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{ name: 'Rocko', age: 3 }\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>JSON</code>, ardından <code>parse</code> ve son olarak <code>dog</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir JSON dizesini <code>JSON.parse()</code> metoduyla bir JS nesnesine de dönüştürebiliriz.</p><p>Saklanan JSON dizesini bir JS nesnesine dönüştür ve görüntüle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dog = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Rocko&quot;,&quot;age&quot;:3}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".parse(dog));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"stringify\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"age\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{ name: 'Rocko', age: 3 }\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>JSON</code>, ardından <code>parse</code> ve son olarak <code>dog</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: json.stringify",
            "id": 120530,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir JS nesnesini JSON dizesine nasıl dönüştürebiliriz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>JSON.stringify</code> ile</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>JSON.parse</code> ile</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>JSON.stringify</code> ile.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir JavaScript nesnen var ve içeriğini JSON dizesi olarak göndermen gerekiyor. Bu yöndeki dönüşümü hangi metot gerçekleştirir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>JSON.stringify</code> ile</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>JSON.parse</code> ile</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>JSON.object</code> ile</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>JSON.stringify</code> ile öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Q: JSON.stringify",
            "id": 120531,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Konsol ne görüntüleyecek?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" birthday = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"attendees\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"dressCode\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".stringify(birthday));\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;attendees&quot;:13,&quot;dressCode&quot;:false}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>{\"attendees\": 13, \"dressCode\": false}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>{attendees: 13, dressCode : false}</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>{\"attendees\": 13, \"dressCode\": false}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodu çalıştırmadan önce <code>dressCode</code> değerini <code>true</code> olarak değiştiriyorsun. Konsol şimdi ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" birthday = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"attendees\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"dressCode\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".stringify(birthday));\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;attendees&quot;:13,&quot;dressCode&quot;:false}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>{\"attendees\":13,\"dressCode\":true}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>{\"attendees\":13,\"dressCode\":false}</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>{\"attendees\":13,\"dressCode\":\"true\"}</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>{\"attendees\":13,\"dressCode\":true}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: JSON strings",
            "id": 120532,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki JSON'u tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" charity = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;name&quot;: &quot;bestHelp&quot;, &quot;donors&quot;: 123 }'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>'</code>, ardından <code>\"</code> ve sonra <code>\"</code>, <code>'</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki JSON'u tamamla. Nesnenin tamamını tek bir JavaScript dizesinin içinde tut ve anahtarını tırnak içine al.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" charity = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;name&quot;: &quot;bestHelp&quot;, &quot;donors&quot;: 123 }'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"`\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"donors\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"bestHelp\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>'</code>, ardından <code>name</code>, <code>\"</code>, <code>\"</code> ve son olarak <code>'</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: JSON.parse",
            "id": 120533,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Console çıktısında bir JS nesnesi görmemiz için <code>brochure</code> JSON dizesini <em>ayrıştır</em>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" brochure = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;title&quot;: &quot;Summer Vacation&quot;, &quot;destination&quot;:&quot;France&quot;}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" parsedBrochure = \" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".parse(brochure);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(parsedBrochure);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"106\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{ title: 'Summer Vacation', destination: 'France' }\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>parse</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
